where $\Omega$ denotes an exterior domain in $\mathbb{R}^N$ with $N\ge 3$. The paper derives optimal nonexistence results for positive supersolutions, utilizing a nonexistence theorem for positive supersolutions of a linear elliptic problem involving a Hardy potential. Additionally, we establish sharp nonexistence results concerning positive supersolutions for an elliptic system.

